{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126090732077-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126100437\"/><p>今早陸續有市民到場獻花。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>今日(26日)為大埔宏福苑大火一周年，大火奪去168條人命，亦令數以千計居民痛失家園。今早陸續有市民到場獻花。有部分人獻花後，閉目、雙手合十，在心中悼念罹難者。有市民在花束上留下卡片，希望逝者安息，真相得以彰顯。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.675882+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T01:07:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:19.920542+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:19.920542+00:00","content_hash":"96bbbcdd6f01d7ef26480a667125320b4fe29236267abfa239f4f115f97962b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}